  Close the [parser issue](https://github.com/josetorres1/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1)
  as completed.
- Hint: **WON'T FIX**. The engineering note is `booking-v3 form retired`.
  Close the [hint issue](https://github.com/josetorres1/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2)
  as not planned. Retirement is not a hint fix.

These outcomes come from the desk update. This review did not run the product or
independently verify its deployment. The original export and its calculated
counts remain unchanged.

